# Slate -- cool, low-glare, built for long sessions.
#
# Pure white on pure black for four hours is punishing. The white is pulled
# down, the black lifted, and the hue separation left alone, so it still reads
# at a glance in a lit room.

name    Slate
blurb   Cool and low-glare. Built for long sessions.

# --- interface roles -------------------------------------------------------
ui      canvas      0E1116
ui      panel       161B22
ui      border      2D3742
ui      title       E3B341
